1sd4|n|Hazard; danger; peril; exposure to loss, injury, or destruction. ; Hazard of loss; liabillity to loss in property. ; To expose to risk, hazard, or peril; to venture; as, to risk goods on board of a ship; to risk one's person in battle; to risk one's fame by a publication. ; To incur the risk or danger of; as, to risk a battle.	a:12lq,70,4;1m14,40,6;yp2,35,10;yoz,34,14;1dbl,32,3;1wdh,32,3;1pse,24,3;17zd,24,4;1gtw,23,8;16ui,10,3;1cca,5,5;1xt5,0,8~yoz,34,14;yp2,35,10;1gtw,23,8;1xt5,0,8;1m14,40,6;1cca,5,5;17zd,24,4;12lq,70,4;1dbl,32,3;1wdh,32,3;1pse,24,3;16ui,10,3	V:9yn,69,6;i3a,42,1~9yn,69,6;i3a,42,1	n:sjz,56,7;xuy,42,3;1dbl,16,1;16ui,10,3;2b4z,8,4;yp2,2,1~sjz,56,7;2b4z,8,4;xuy,42,3;16ui,10,3;yp2,2,1;1dbl,16,1	N:99y,32,1;rhy,18,1~rhy,18,1;99y,32,1
1sd9|n|	a:18mf,52,3~18mf,52,3	v:22gm,28,3~22gm,28,3	V:561,74,5;140p,47,2~561,74,5;140p,47,2	n:xuy,70,5;1t8u,67,4~xuy,70,5;1t8u,67,4
1sda|a|Attended with risk or danger; hazardous.	e:24mq,39,6;297h,37,7;16ui,24,1;1c22,11,2~297h,37,7;24mq,39,6;1c22,11,2;16ui,24,1
